/target
**/*.rs.bk
Cargo.lock.tmp
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.log
.envrc
.direnv/
.claude/*.local.md
.superpowers/
# Any depth: a node_modules outside client/ is build output too, and the
# unicode gate enumerates untracked files, so an un-ignored one is scanned.
node_modules/
client/dist/
# The Tauri shell's own crate is not a workspace member, so `/target` above
# anchors at the repo root and misses this one.
client/src-tauri/target/
client/src-tauri/gen/schemas/
# Stryker's sandbox copy of the client and the report a run writes. The
# sandbox is deleted at the end of a successful run and kept when a run
# errors, so a crashed one must not read as a dirty tree.
.stryker-tmp/
client/reports/
